   "value": "End Conversation",
   "was": null,
   "why": "09.10.2026 мультиязычность, этап 6: перевод без EN-источника (manual)",
   "source": "manual"
  },
  {
   "key": "144npc_21.Text",
   "value": "You'll make a fine Trapper. I guarantee it.\r\nHere! As promised, the rest of the book.",
