  {
   "key": "tomb1_63.Text",
   "value": "O fool who missed the hour of his death.\nBehind your back, you who survived,\nthere are only the screams of passion, pride and comrades.\n\nWhy did you not know that this world holds a life that crawls through darkness\nand a death as radiant as light?\nFor you who have lost your pride,\neven a grave is too good.\n",
